  "answerAnalysis": "\n\n\n火冬\n\n\n\n首先我们来看看示例:\n\n<div class=\"container p-3\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_1.webp\" class=\"w-100\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n从示例中看到，我们的答案需要和谜题的问号一样进行伸缩。\n其中第一个谜题为“筒”去掉“同”的部件，即竹字头；第二个谜题是safe（安全）的下半部分，其中文部分的下半部分为“女王”。\n\n<div class=\"container p-3\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_2.webp\" class=\"w-100\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n那现在，让我们来观察原图。\n\n<h2>小题</h2>\n\n<h3>犬和三撇</h3>\n\n<div class=\"container p-3 text-center\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_3.webp\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n这里指的是“倏”和“修”两个汉字的右下角。方格上方都标注了拼音。这个的正确答案是“亻”，单人旁。左上角的版本需要转置。\n\n<h3>讯计</h3>\n\n<div class=\"container p-3 text-center\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_4.webp\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n本题需要的部件是“讯”和“计”的差值，即横斜钩。\n\n<h3>PULL PUSH</h3>\n\n<div class=\"container p-3 text-center\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_5.webp\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n本题巧妙地运用了中文“推拉”和英文pull，push相同的左侧。答案为“推拉”共同的左侧，“扌”。\n\n<h3>横竖</h3>\n\n<div class=\"container p-3 text-center\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_6.webp\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n“横”的右半部分是“黄”，所以提取“竖”的下半部分，“立”。\n\n<h3>Dog</h3>\n\n<div class=\"container p-3 text-center\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_7.webp\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n这里是dog，也就是“犬”的上半部分，即横，一小竖和点的结构。\n\n<h3>化学式</h3>\n\n<div class=\"container p-3 text-center\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_8.webp\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n这是“王水”的化学方程式。\n\n<h3>1=A</h3>\n\n<div class=\"container p-3 text-center\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_9.webp\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n这是扑克牌的点数，其中11 = J， 注意J是衬线字体。\n\n<h3>音和义</h3>\n\n<div class=\"container p-3 text-center\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_10.webp\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n这个词念作 *fengxian* ，意思为付出，该词语答案为“奉献”，提取答案左边的下方，得到两横一竖的结果。\n\n<h3>多多</h3>\n\n<div class=\"container p-3 text-center\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_11.webp\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n这里其实是“七夕”，代表有七个“夕”字。\n\n<h3>图形类比</h3>\n\n<div class=\"container p-3 text-center\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_12.webp\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n简单图的互补关系（右边图形加上左边图形构成X个顶点互相相连一次的图形），右边是一个长方形。\n\n<h2>提取</h2>\n\n<div class=\"container p-3\">\n    <img src=\"/config/jhjm2024/static/assets/solution_resources/byline/byline_13.webp\" class=\"w-100\" alt=\"pic\">\n</div>\n\n可以看出“气球花拉丁名”六个字[^1]，因此答案就是气球花这个物种的拉丁名称，<br>\n**GOMPHOCARPUS PHYSOCARPUS**，同样满足右下角的（12 11）枚举。\n\n[^1]: “气”其实缺一横，不过看得出来。\n\n<style>\n.container {\n    margin: auto;\n}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n"
